Apple today <a href="https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/news/2026/11/apples-global-hit-juggernaut-ted-lasso-lands-season-five-renewal/">announced</a> that its award-winning comedy series <em>Ted Lasso</em> has been renewed for a fifth season. <a href="https://deadline.com/2026/11/ted-lasso-renewed-season-5-apple-tv-1237231022/"><em>Deadline</em> reported</a> that Apple is aiming to begin production on April 14, but a release date for the fifth season has yet to be announced.<br/>
<br/>
